<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>digital-products-prompts</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #111; }
h1 { font-size: 18pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<p>StartbusinessAI Prompt Pack: Digital Products and Ebooks<br><br>1. Product Ideas<br>Generate 20 digital product ideas for [audience] who struggle with [problem].<br><br>2. Buyer Pain<br>Map the biggest pains, desired outcomes, and objections for [audience].<br><br>3. Product Validation<br>Create a validation plan for a digital product about [topic].<br><br>4. Ebook Outline<br>Create a practical ebook outline for [topic] with chapters and exercises.<br><br>5. Template Idea<br>Suggest 10 templates that would help [audience] save time.<br><br>6. Product Name<br>Create 20 product names for [digital product].<br><br>7. Sales Page<br>Write a sales page for [product] with headline, benefits, what&#39;s included, FAQ, and CTA.<br><br>8. Gumroad Description<br>Write a Gumroad product description for [product].<br><br>9. Bonus Ideas<br>Suggest 10 bonuses that increase the value of [product].<br><br>10. Launch Plan<br>Create a 7-day simple launch plan for [product].<br><br>11. Customer Onboarding<br>Write a usage guide for buyers of [product].<br><br>12. Improvement Plan<br>Create a plan to improve [product] after the first 10 buyers.<br></p>
</body>
</html>
